+# AI Studio output protocol — append to every phase prompt
+
+## New file
+
+```
+=== FILE: app/src/main/java/com/shadowspark/morontomornica/<path>.kt ===
+```kotlin
+package com.shadowspark.morontomornica.<path>
+
+// full file content; 2-space indent; trailing commas; match existing style
+```
+=== END FILE ===
+```
+
+## Existing file — minimal patch only
+
+```
+=== PATCH: app/src/main/java/.../SomeFile.kt ===
+CONTEXT: <unique existing snippet to anchor the edit>
+INSERT AFTER:
+```kotlin
+<block to add>
+```
+=== END PATCH ===
+```
+Or `REPLACE BLOCK:` with old snippet / `---` / new snippet. Never rewrite a whole existing file.
+
+## Completion report (mandatory after every phase)
+
+- **FILES CREATED:** repo-relative paths
+- **FILES PATCHED:** paths + one-line reason
+- **EXISTING SYMBOLS USED:** `symbol → file:line`
+- **UNIT-VERIFIED:** `not executed in AI Studio; pending local ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest`
+- **BUILD-VERIFIED:** `pending local ./gradlew :app:lintDebug :app:assembleDebug`
+- **DEVICE-VERIFIED:** `pending emulator/instrumented run by owner`
+- **UNVERIFIED:** every claim lacking executed evidence
+- **GUARDRAIL CHECKLIST:** items 1–5 from the sync prompt marked OK / N/A + reason
+- **NEXT:** exact next phase prompt name
+
+## Rules
+
+- Package declaration must match the target folder (`core/reco/ → core.reco`, `ui/home/ → ui.home`, …).
+- Pure logic files (recommender, store seam, shelf model) must not import Android framework classes.
+- Screens take `uiState: MornicaUiState` and `router: PlaybackRouter`; never instantiate a second player or state holder.
+- Colors come from `com.shadowspark.morontomornica.ui.*` tokens; do not invent a palette.
+- If the imported code disagrees with this protocol, trust the code and report the mismatch instead of forcing the template.
