+
+```text
+Execute Phase A of the Mornica Spotify-grade upgrade. SCOPE: pure logic + persistence seam + tests. No new Composable screens, no dependency additions, no manifest changes, no edits to UI files.
+
+CREATE these files (reference the skill templates in assets/templates/core, assets/templates/data, assets/templates/ui/home, assets/templates/tests when available; otherwise generate conforming code from this brief):
+
+1. core/reco/OnDeviceRecommender.kt — pure Kotlin; recordPlay(trackId, atMs); recentTracks(tracks, limit); favoriteTracks(tracks, favorites); mostPlayed(tracks, limit); topArtists(tracks, maxArtists, perArtist); clear(); historySize(). Only tracks where LocalMediaTrack.isPlayableOffline() qualify. No Android imports.
