+# Feature matrix — Spotify-grade target vs Mornica today
+
+Information architecture and interaction parity. Brand assets, visuals, and proprietary Spotify code are never copied; Mornica keeps its own palette (`ui/MornicaTheme.kt`).
+
+| # | Spotify-equivalent capability | Mornica today (main `aa5d78d`) | Target in this skill | Template | Phase | Gate |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Home feed with personalized shelves (Recent, Liked, Made-for-you, Artists) | None; `My Music` list-only | `HomeFeedScreen` + `OnDeviceRecommender` shelves | `ui/home/HomeFeedScreen.kt`, `core/reco/OnDeviceRecommender.kt`, `ui/home/HomeFeedModel.kt` | A→B | unit + lint + assemble |
+| 2 | Full search (track/artist/album) with chips | Local filter box in library only | `SearchScreen` with chips + results grouped | `ui/search/SearchScreen.kt` | B | unit + assemble |
+| 3 | Playlists: create, rename, delete, add/remove, reorder | `addToPlaylist(name, id)` in-memory map; no rename/delete/reorder | `PlaylistStore` seam + list/create + detail with rename/delete/reorder | `data/local/PlaylistRepository.kt`, `ui/playlist/PlaylistListScreen.kt`, `ui/playlist/PlaylistDetailScreen.kt` | A→C | unit tests |
+| 4 | Downloads / Offline shelf with state per track | `CatalogDownloadManager` + states in `MornicaUiState.catalogDownloadStates`; no dedicated screen | `DownloadsScreen` (queued/downloading/completed/failed, remove offline copy) | `ui/library/DownloadsScreen.kt` | B | unit + assemble |
+| 5 | Now Playing: large artwork zone, queue list, like, share, sleep timer, transport | `NowPlayingFullSheet` with slider + shuffle/repeat/transport; no queue list, no timer, no share | `NowPlayingEnhanced.kt`: queue section, sleep timer, share intent, artwork slot (local MediaStore art optional) | `ui/player/NowPlayingEnhanced.kt`, `core/state/SleepTimerController.kt` | C | instrumented playback + unit |
+| 6 | Queue management: view list, remove, jump-to, reorder | `queueTrackIds` list; skip next/previous; no UI list | Queue section in enhanced player; remove/jump helpers on router state | `ui/player/NowPlayingEnhanced.kt` | C | unit |
+| 7 | Settings (offline/wifi-only, theme, about, privacy, storage) | Wi-Fi toggle inside catalog card; no settings screen | `SettingsScreen` wired to existing `setWifiOnlyDownloads` + privacy URL | `ui/settings/SettingsScreen.kt` | B | assemble |
+| 8 | Recommendations / discovery from listening history | None; static demo catalog | On-device heuristics: recent, favorites, top artists, top tracks; zero network | `core/reco/OnDeviceRecommender.kt` | A | pure-JUnit tests |
+| 9 | Persistent library state across restarts | Favorites/playlists in-memory; downloads in JSON `DownloadStore` | `PlaylistStore` JSON persistence (Room migration path documented) | `data/local/PlaylistRepository.kt` | A→D | unit + device relaunch |
+| 10 | Per-track metadata + album art | Title/artist/album/folder/duration; no art slot | Artwork slot composable; optional MediaStore art loader (Phase D, no new permission) | `ui/components/ShelfComponents.kt`, config snippet for Coil (optional) | D | assemble |
+| 11 | Catalog data source (real licensed backend) | Demo fixtures only; `CatalogSource` seam exists, `LicensedCatalogBackendSource` empty/fail-closed | Backend contract: Firestore metadata + signed CDN URLs; gate unchanged | `references/data-source-contract.md` | D (owner-approved backend project) | rights-gate tests |
+| 12 | Notification / lock-screen transport | Media3 `MediaSessionService` active; demo recorded | Keep; Phase C verifies queue metadata on session | existing `LocalAudioPlaybackService` | C | device proof |
+| 13 | App-wide navigation state | 3 bottom tabs only; route state absent | `MornicaRoute` holder; overlay screens without breaking bottom nav tests | `ui/nav/MornicaRoute.kt` | B | accessibility tests untouched |
+| 14 | Empty / permission / offline states | Library permission banner exists | Reused across new screens with same Mornica tokens | `ui/components/ShelfComponents.kt` | B | assemble |
+
+## Out of scope (do not build under this skill)
+
+- Spotify account login, social/following, comments, lyrics service, podcasts, audiobooks, ads, paywalls.
+- Any YouTube stream extraction, background YouTube audio, or third-party ripping SDK.
+- Cloud sync of user libraries until a backend contract is owner-approved (`data-source-contract.md`).
+- iOS binary (separate cross-platform project; this skill targets the Android repo only).
