+# Phased execution plan
+
+One branch per phase. Stop at a red gate; do not stack phases on failing state. All commands run from repo root with the pinned Gradle 9.8.2 wrapper.
+
+## Executor modes
+
+- **Local agent (Hermes/Android Studio agent):** follow this plan directly; copy `assets/templates/` files, apply `assets/templates/patches/`, run `scripts/verify.sh`.
+- **Google AI Studio (repo imported):** use `assets/ai-studio/` prompts instead. Paste `00-sync-prompt.md` first, then the phase prompt (`02`–`05`). AI Studio generates file/patch blocks but cannot run Gradle; the owner applies them, runs `scripts/verify.sh`, and feeds gate output back before the next phase. No phase advances on UNVERIFIED playback claims.
+
+## Pre-flight (every session)
+
+```bash
+git fetch origin
+git checkout main && git pull origin main
+git status --short          # confirm no uncommitted local-only gradle tweaks hidden from review
+git checkout -b feat/mornica-spotify-phase<N>-<slug>
+```
+
+## Phase A — Foundation logic (no visual change)
+
+**Scope**
+- `core/reco/OnDeviceRecommender.kt` + `ui/home/HomeFeedModel.kt`
+- `data/local/PlaylistRepository.kt` (`PlaylistStore` seam, in-memory + SharedPreferences JSON)
+- `ui/nav/MornicaRoute.kt`
+- Tests: `OnDeviceRecommenderTest`, `PlaylistRepositoryTest`, `HomeFeedModelTest`
+
+**Acceptance**
+- New logic covered by unit tests; existing 75 tests untouched and green.
+- No new dependency; no new permission; no UI wiring yet (compiles, unused symbols allowed only if referenced by Phase B patch — prefer wiring in B).
+- Gate: `testDebugUnitTest` green, `lintDebug` 0 errors, `assembleDebug` OK.
+
+**Commit:** `feat(mornica-spotify): add recommender, playlist store seam, route holder`
+
+## Phase B — Browse shell (Home, Search, Downloads, Settings)
+
+**Scope**
+- Patches: `MornicaRuntime` (attach store + recommender), `MainActivity` (wire store), `MornicaApp.kt` (nav holder + overlay + header actions).
+- Screens: `HomeFeedScreen`, `SearchScreen`, `DownloadsScreen`, `SettingsScreen`, `components/ShelfComponents`.
+- Reuse router methods only; do not alter `PrimaryScreen` enum (accessibility test iterates `entries`).
+
+**Acceptance**
+- Home shows shelves from real `uiState.localTracks` + favorites; Search filters local tracks; Downloads lists catalog states; Settings toggles Wi-Fi-only via router; all screens reachable through `MornicaNav` overlay with Back handling.
+- Device smoke: emulator launch, navigate each overlay, play one demo track from Home, toggle Wi-Fi-only, return. Record screenshots + logcat in `EXECUTION_LOG.md`.
+- Gates: unit + lint + assemble; accessibility test (`MornicaAccessibilityTest`) still green.
+
+**Commit:** `feat(mornica-spotify): home feed, search, downloads and settings overlays`
+
+## Phase C — Player depth (queue, sleep timer, share, playlist CRUD)
+
+**Scope**
+- `core/state/SleepTimerController.kt`, `ui/player/NowPlayingEnhanced.kt`.
+- `ui/playlist/PlaylistListScreen.kt` (create dialog, open detail), `ui/playlist/PlaylistDetailScreen.kt`
+  (rename, delete, add-current-track, reorder, remove-track); `PlaylistStore.create(name)` seam method.
+- Router patch (approved, additive): `removeFromQueue(trackId)`, `playQueueIndex(index)`.
